ID: Ch6-Upset
TEXT:

#if(v_ch3_kate_badly_hurt == 0) {
"I'm sorry, I meant to tell you sooner, but I was afraid you'd get upset."

"So you figured that the best way to go at it was to keep lying to me?"

"No, it's—"

"I've heard enough. Let's keep moving. We shouldn't be wasting any more time."

He turns on his heel and marches down the path, armor clanking with every stride, not looking back.

