I half expect Daren to jump in with a sarcastic jab about nursery toys, but he keeps his eyes fixed on the treeline. The silence is worse than the mockery.

"It's an amplifier," I tell her. "It draws ambient mana from the air and channels it into muscle fiber and nerve response."

