ID: Ch6-Sword-strength
TEXT:

#if(v_ch6_defense == 1 && v_strength < 4) {

The steel strikes the center of his breastplate scales with a dull clang, failing to bite. Tyrath's left claw sweeps across my ribs; I snap a combat teleport, reappearing twenty paces back.

His wings clap together, sending a concussive gust that sends me tumbling through the sky. Disoriented, I take three seconds to reacquire his position.

}
#if(v_ch6_defense == 2 && v_strength < 4) {

The steel strikes the center of his breastplate scales with a dull clang, failing to bite. Tyrath's left claw sweeps across my ribs; I snap a combat teleport, reappearing twenty paces back.

His wings clap together in a deafening blast, but my wind ward absorbs the shockwave; I remain stationary in mid-air.

For a fraction of a second, two dragons flicker in the sky before one dissolves. An illusion. The wing-clap was meant to blind me to his displacement.

I cast true sight. The decoy in front of me disappears, revealing the real Tyrath diving from my right flank.

I teleport directly beside him and swing Daren's blade. Taken by surprise, the dragon teleports out of range before the steel can land.

}
#if(v_ch6_defense == 3 && v_strength < 4) {

The steel strikes the center of his breastplate scales with a dull clang, failing to bite. Tyrath's left claw sweeps across my ribs; I snap a combat teleport, reappearing twenty paces back.

His wings clap together in a deafening blast, but my wind ward absorbs the shockwave; I remain stationary in mid-air.

The dragon leaves an illusion decoy behind while circling from my right flank. My pre-cast true sight pierces the glamour instantly.

I teleport directly beside him and swing Daren's blade. Taken by surprise, the dragon teleports out of range before the steel can land.

}
#if(v_ch6_defense == 1 && v_strength == 4) {

The blow lands with bone-cracking force. Daren's blade shatters an iron scale and drives two inches into the dragon's chest meat. Tyrath roars in agony, snap-teleporting ten paces back.

His wings clap together, sending a concussive gust that sends me tumbling through the sky. Disoriented, I take three seconds to reacquire his position.

}
