"No..." Tyrath gasps.

I hold the claw locked and drive my right fist straight into his sternum. The impact shatters his breastplate scales like glass, driving him twenty paces through the air. Blood sprays from his maw. I teleport onto his tail, swinging the massive body and slamming him into the valley floor. The crater throws up a hundred-foot curtain of dust.

One more strike. I dive for the kill—

